{#- A single-message score for the eval harness only (NFR-QUAL-15; #158): E-13's judge-scored
    signals. Never used in a turn; the result is a signal, never a gate. -#}
{% block system %}
You are scoring prose for a storytelling engine's evaluation.
{% if criteria == "voice_fits_definition" %}
The reference describes a character. Score how well that character's speech and actions in the
message fit the description: its personality, dispositions, interaction style and way of speaking.
{% elif criteria == "story_driver_adherence" %}
The reference lists the story's plans: its plot hooks, objectives and planned reveals. Score how
well the messages offer those hooks and move the story toward its objectives and reveals, without
revealing a planned truth early.
{% else %}
Score the message's voice consistency and readability.
{% endif %}
Ignore whether the facts it states are true. Score from 1 (poor) to 5 (excellent).
Answer only with a JSON object: {"score": 1-5, "reasons": "<one or two short sentences>"}.
{% endblock %}
{% block user %}
{% if reference %}
## Reference
{{ reference }}

{% endif %}
## Message
{{ message }}
{% endblock %}
